{"id":"sattel","lemma":"Sattel","pos":"noun","rank":4953,"glosses":["saddle","nut of a string instrument (supporting strings at the head end)"],"ipa":"/ˈzatl̩/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/97/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-Sattel.wav/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-Sattel.wav.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Sattels","plural":"Sättel"},"formAudio":{"Sattels":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/7e/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-Sattels.wav","Sättel":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/7c/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-S%C3%A4ttel.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Früher sind wir ohne Sattel geritten.","en":"We used to ride horses with no saddles.","words":[{"g":"formerly, in the past"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"we"},{"g":"without"},null,{"g":"to ride","l":"reiten"}]},{"text":"Tom schwang sich hoch in den Sattel.","en":"Tom swung up into the saddle.","words":[null,{"g":"to swing","l":"schwingen"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"high, tall"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},null]},{"text":"Tom ritt ohne Sattel.","en":"Tom rode the horse bareback.","words":[null,{"g":"to ride","l":"reiten"},{"g":"without"},null]},{"text":"Die meisten Reiter, denen es ernst ist, besitzen einen eigenen Sattel.","en":"Most serious riders own their own saddles.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"much, a lot","l":"viel"},{"g":"rider"},{"g":"whom, which, that"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"serious, severe, grave"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"to own, to possess"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},{"g":"own","l":"eigen"},null]},{"text":"Mut heißt sich mit Todesangst dennoch in den Sattel schwingen.","en":"Courage is being scared to death, but saddling up anyway.","words":[{"g":"courage"},{"g":"to have a name","l":"heißen"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"fear of death"},{"g":"anyhow, however"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},null,{"g":"to swing"}]}]}